SECTION: next_steps

Another List-shaped Section. These items are rendered by an ordered list in the
Template, showing that the same Section data can be presented however the Template
chooses.
#}

- Open the Template and find the welcome, concepts, and next_steps Section references.
- Open the welcome Section, then click target_summary() to navigate to its Function.
- Change one line in the concepts Section and regenerate to see a List-shaped Section update.
- Edit target_summary and regenerate to see Function output flow through its parent Section.
- Generate from Job Tracker to supply a real job_ref company and title to this document.
- After that, try a JAW generation block inside a Section or Function; Templates do not generate directly.
